<div class="graphics-article-title" >
  FW20 Totes + Socks
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text" style="padding-top: 10px;">
  <p>
    Socks and totes are the unsung workhorses of our FW20 collection.  
  </p> 
  <p>
    Let’s start with the humble tote. 
    A simple object that’s become increasingly essential with NY state's recent ban on plastic bags. 
    Sure, you can buy a plastic one from Key Foods with birthday balloons printed on it that you’ll use once and then throw away, but why not be a good citizen and get something you’ll reuse. 
    Ours are made in the USA of organic cotton, have self-fabric handles, and have heavy thread tex chain stitching throughout so can load it up with plenty of gear and not worry about a strap busting. Subtle tonal branding is on all 3 colorways.
  </p>
</div>

