<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
 	Our socks are woven in Japan by vintage machines assembled in the 1970s. It’s not the most efficient, producing only 50 pairs a day, but that’s the price to pay for this kind of thickness and durability. 
    Natural materials and high quality yarns produce what we think are the best sport socks in the world. 
    If there was one product that stuck to our ethos of “if you can’t do it right, don’t do it.“, these socks are probably it. 
    The Core Logo sock features intarsia knit artwork for a traditional look or the Classic Comfort sock for a more modern dual rib knit construction and direct embroidery art.
  </p>
